    date "2019-07-25T00:16:37Z"
    title "Dervaes Family Farm | The Urban Homestead | Episode 94"
    description "Be sure to check out our current content, we are up to some great garden adventures here on the Urban Gardener channel!&#10;And if you enjoyed this episode check out our episode on the Noble Rot rooftop garden:&#10;https://youtu.be/pd_TIYGH35A&#10;&#10;In this episode, we are invited to Pasadena California to the Dervaes family farm, internationally known as The Urban Homestead. The children of founder Jules Dervaes continue his legacy and maintain the family urban farm, its CSA, and its teachings.&#10;Justin Dervaes gives us a short tour around the gardens and sits down for an interview about where they are now.&#10;&#10;Episode #94&#10;Let's Get Growing!&#10;&#10;The Urban Homestead website:&#10;https://urbanhomestead.org/&#10;&#10;The Urban Homestead on Facebook:&#10;https://www.facebook.com/urbanhomestead&#10;&#10;Please &#34;LIKE&#34; our video, COMMENT below, and of course, SUBSCRIBE to follow along with more of our Garden Adventures.&#10;&#10;To connect with other gardeners JOIN our Gardening Group on FB:&#10;https://www.facebook.com/groups/theurbangardener &#10;&#10;&#8220;LIKE&#8221; our Facebook Page for more content:&#10;https://www.facebook.com/theurbangardener17&#10;&#10;t.U.G on Instagram:&#10;https://www.instagram.com/theurbangardener1/&#10;&#10;t.U.G. on Twitter:&#10;https://twitter.com/urbangardener17 &#10;&#10;t.U.G. on TikTok:&#10;https://www.tiktok.com/@enoch.theurbangardener?lang=en &#10;&#10;Go old school and leave a message on our Voicemail Line:&#10;(458) 246-UGOR (Urban Gardener ORegon)&#10;      8.4.6.7.&#10;&#10;#gardening #growfood #letsgetgrowing #containergarden #raisedbeds #urbangarden #urbanfarm #theurbanhomestead #legacy #familyfarm"
