    id 14
    label "shIfzNOcNvs"
    step 0
    date "2020-03-27T13:24:07Z"
    title "How To Turn Your Lawn Into A Vegetable Garden"
    description "In this video I&#8217;ll show how I removed my weed filled lawn then amended the soil and create garden and beds to grows a wide range of fruits and vegetables. &#10;&#10;Here is a full video list of every step I've taken so far to create and maintain an incredibly productive and widely diverse organic vegetable garden. &#10;&#10;Step 1. Soil Test:&#10;https://youtu.be/nB-wX0ZYNME&#10;&#10;Step 2. Soil Prep (this video):&#10;https://youtu.be/shIfzNOcNvs&#10;&#10;Step 3. Pathways:&#10;https://youtu.be/QfRQtx_c55o&#10;&#10;Step 4. Irrigation:&#10;https://youtu.be/yDedR-GErUk&#10;&#10;Step 5. Planting:&#10;https://youtu.be/bMaqwrelms4&#10;&#10;Step 6. Tomato Trellising:&#10;https://youtu.be/NnTGFhXWAsk&#10;&#10;Step 7. Trellis Build:&#10;https://youtu.be/NzBhH8K_qp4&#10;&#10;Step 8. Fertilizing and Maintenance:&#10;https://youtu.be/5REItIg6ifo Soon&#10;&#10;Step 9. Fall Garden Prep and Planting&#10;https://youtu.be/7OjBRH39OwE&#10;&#10;Step 10: Pest Management (Organic)&#10;Coming Soon - be sure to SUBSCRIBE!&#10;My favorite soil amendment/potting soil:&#10;https://www.recipe420.com/products/&#10;&#10;The Starter Fertilizer I use when planting every plant in my garden: https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B00OVCA7GU/ref=as_li_tl?ie=UTF8&#38;tag=kylehagerurba-20&#38;camp=1789&#38;creative=9325&#38;linkCode=as2&#38;creativeASIN=B00OVCA7GU&#38;linkId=985b046e4f2e963c231621bb226abd89&#10;&#10;The Organic Vegetable Fertilizer I Use: https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B00BJAOYB6/ref=as_li_tl?ie=UTF8&#38;tag=kylehagerurba-20&#38;camp=1789&#38;creative=9325&#38;linkCode=as2&#38;creativeASIN=B00BJAOYB6&#38;linkId=eb8d9cb483e8dffb2835f1d4d61603de&#10;&#10;GARDEN PRODUCTS I USE:&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/urbanfarmstead&#10;&#10;Other favorite organic soil amendments and fertilizers&#10;https://www.ebstone.org/products/eb-stone-organics&#10;&#10;Organic Nitrogen Fertilizer (Blood Meal):&#10;https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BJRL42Q/?ref=exp_urbanfarmstead_dp_vv_d&#10;&#10;Other products I use:&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/urbanfarmstead&#10;&#10;FOLLOW ME ON:&#10;Instagram:https://www.instagram.com/urbanfarmstead/?hl=en&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/theurbanfarmstead/&#10;&#10;&#10;Music: Morning Mandoline by Chris Haugen"
