    description "GROW A MANGO TREE FROM A STORE BOUGHT MANGO&#10;MANGO SEED GERMINATION | HOW TO GROW MANGOES AT HOME&#10;&#10;SEED SOWING TIME : JUNE TO SEPTEMBER IS THE IDEAL TIME (CAN BE GROWN THROUGHOUT THE YEAR )&#10;&#10;Reportedly, in India alone, there are around 283 types of mangoes, out of which only 30 are well-known such as Alphonso Mangoes - Ratnagiri, Maharashtra. ...&#10;Kesar Mangoes - Junagadh, Gujarat. ...&#10;Dasheri Mangoes - Lucknow and Malihabad, Uttar Pradesh. ...&#10;Himsagar and Kishan Bhog Mangoes - Murshidabad, West Bengal. ...&#10;Chausa Mangoes - Hardoi, Uttar Pradesh. ...&#10;Badami Mangoes - North Karnataka.&#10;&#10;MUSIC: &#10;&#10;Title: Parasail by Silent Partner&#10;Genre and Mood: Rock + Bright&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MzO4zfNO0kQ&#38;list=RDMzO4zfNO0kQ&#38;start_radio=1&#10;&#10;Title: Grass by Silent Partner&#10;Genre and Mood: Ambient + Inspirational&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VlohuOGWzG8&#10;&#10;Title: Days Are Long by Silent Partner&#10;Genre and Mood: Cinematic + Sad&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dMWPj0wu1Dw&#10;&#10;Title: Cha Cappella by Jimmy Fontanez, Media Right Productions&#10;Genre and Mood: Jazz &#38; Blues + Happy&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5gj2WkkEcIE"
