    title "How To Grow Chillies At Home|100+ chillies per plant|Seed To Harvest"
    description "GROW CHILLY PLANT FROM CHILLIES  AT HOME | FULL INFORMATION SEED TO HARVEST...:)&#10;DAIZZ'S TIPS:-&#10;Growing a chilli plant from a seed can be a fun and easy endeavor! Germinate chilli seeds in a warm, consistent temperature and use a light compost to sprout seedlings. Carefully transfer a seedling to a small pot, keeping it warm and watered. Upgrade pots as the plant grows, or transfer it to your garden if the weather is warm enough. Pick chillis off of your plant regularly as a flavorful addition to your meals!&#10;Please subscribe to my Instagram account.Thanks&#10;link:-https://www.instagram.com/urbangarden...&#10;&#10;Thank you for watching and please give me a Like and I would love you to SUBSCRIBE for regular updates and take a look at my other Videos...thank u..:)&#10;&#10;MUSIC:-&#10;&#10;Song: Jarico - Retrovi (Vlog No Copyright Music) Music promoted by Vlog No Copyright Music. Video Link: https://youtu.be/2w9P1yvAkBw&#10;&#10;Song: Markvard - Time (Vlog No Copyright Music) Music provided by Vlog No Copyright Music. Video Link: https://youtu.be/NvZ3CN-vvsw&#10;&#10;HEY GIRL&#10;&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qVX1QYtMjAk&#38;index=3&#38;list=PLrRVQ9K_8q5QFHikXYxFlvLT1krD1d9vx&#10;The Wilhelm Scream (Kygo Remix) | No Copyright&#10;&#8226; Music Master&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/Musicmasterpm&#10;Tumblr: http://musicmasterpm.tumblr.com/&#10;&#10;&#8226; kygo&#10;Soundcloud: https://soundcloud.com/kygo&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/kygoofficial&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/KygoMusic"
