    id 23
    label "l9GLBA6oWjk"
    step 0
    date "2021-12-25T07:14:50Z"
    title "How to Grow Garlic in Water | QUICK N EASY WAY | FULL GUIDE"
    description "How to Grow Lots of Garlic | Planting to Harvest&#10;&#10;GROWING TIPS:-&#10;Break apart cloves from the bulb a few days before planting, but keep the papery husk on each individual clove.&#10;Place cloves 2 to 4 inches apart and 2 inches deep, in their upright position (the wide root side facing down and pointed end facing up). &#10;&#10;A good mix of garden soil, compost with a little bit of builder&#8217;s sand will give you the drainage, moisture retention, and nutrients necessary for growing garlic in containers.&#10;&#10;Position the container somewhere that gets at least six hours of direct sunlight on most days, and keep the soil moist but not soggy.&#10;&#10;Harvest when the tops just begin to yellow and fall over, but before they are completely dry.&#10;&#10;&#10;GROWING TIME : SEPTEMBER TO DECEMBER (when the temperature is in the range of 50-85 F (10-30 C))&#10;&#10;BUY IMPORTED VEGETABLE AND FLOWER SEEDS FROM MY SEED SELLER MR. ROHIT (WHATSAPP- 9818174630)&#10;&#10;NATURAL RIVER SAND - 5kg Grey &#10;https://amzn.to/3syf6BV&#10;&#10;BUY GROW BAGS :&#10; UV Treated Grow Bag, Multicolour, 12 x 12 inch, 10 Pieces&#10;https://amzn.to/3lsgZLS&#10;&#10;GROW BAGS: (18x18 inch, Pack of 8) &#10;https://amzn.to/2ZLpYjP&#10;&#10;Homemade Organic Fertilizer Organic &#38; Natural Plant Nutrient Cow Manure, Vermi compost Fertilizer (10 kg)&#10;https://amzn.to/3lrtqHX&#10;&#10;TrustBasket Organic Vermicompost Fertilizer Manure for Plants - 5 KG&#10;https://amzn.to/3plPBR2&#10;&#10;COCOPEAT 4KG BLOCK&#10;https://amzn.to/3rsPLbL&#10;&#10;Cocopeat Block 4 Qty Expands To 100 Kg Coco Peat Powder&#10;https://amzn.to/3rxSm4j&#10;&#10;Bliss of Earth Naturally Organic Kashmiri Garlic 500 gm From Indian Himalayas, Single Clove, Kashmiri &#10;https://amzn.to/3JahYdU&#10;&#10;Foodrack Pure Whole Garlic Whole Lahsun BIG Size Fresh Garlic 900 gram&#10;https://amzn.to/32hwD6F"
