    step 0
    date "2020-06-08T04:42:14Z"
    title "How To Grow Eggplant/Brinjal in Containers (SEED TO HARVEST)"
    description "Grow Aubergine/Brinjal/Eggplant at Home| Fast N Easy&#10;The Eggplant/Brinjal/Aubergine is called the King of Vegetables by some cultures. It is one of the most versatile vegetables around, loved by many people across the world. Different varieties are available everywhere and each variety is unique in its own way, with a distinctive flavor and many essential minerals&#10;CARE TIPS:&#10;The plants ought to have sufficient sunlight.&#10;Stake plants over 24 inches tall.&#10;Water well, keep the soil little moist at all times and apply a balanced fertilizer every two weeks during the growing season.&#10;For bigger fruits, restrict to five or six per plant.&#10;LINKS:&#10;BRINJAL/EGGPLANT SEEDS-&#10;Long Purple-https://nurserylive.com/en/seeds/vegetable-herb-seeds/all-vegetable-herb-seeds/brinjal-ppl-plants-in-india&#10;&#10;Round variety-https://nurserylive.com/en/seeds/vegetable-herb-seeds/all-vegetable-herb-seeds/omx-brinjal-f1-hybrid-round-plants-in-india&#10;White-https://nurserylive.com/en/seeds/vegetable-herb-seeds/all-vegetable-herb-seeds/omx-brinjal-f1-hybrid-white-plants-in-india&#10;Green-https://nurserylive.com/en/seeds/vegetable-herb-seeds/all-vegetable-herb-seeds/omx-brinjal-f1-hybrid-green-long-plants-in-india&#10;&#10;Seaweed extract-https://www.amazon.in/SW-10-G-Seaweed-Extract-Growth-Promoter_500/dp/B01MUCVDHK/ref=sr_1_9?crid=DBOC1YBD27D6&#38;dchild=1&#38;keywords=seaweed+extract+for+plants&#38;qid=1591590913&#38;s=garden&#38;sprefix=sea%2Clawngarden%2C454&#38;sr=1-9&#10;&#10;MUSIC:&#10;&#10;FRESH FALLEN SNOW&#10;&#10;Song: BraveLion - Sleeping Jungle (Vlog No Copyright Music)&#10;Music provided by Vlog No Copyright Music.&#10;Video Link: https://youtu.be/-lXuuGG9d3Y"
