    date "2019-11-18T07:58:21Z"
    title "How To Grow Corn in Containers ( WITH FULL UPDATES)"
    description "HOW TO PLANT CORN AT HOME| how to plant corn at home&#10;Plant seeds 1.5 to 2 inches deep and 4 to 6 inches apart. Soil should be well-draining, but must be able to hold some moisture. Corn tends to use a lot of water.&#10;For sufficient pollination, plan your plot right. Instead of planting two long rows of corn, plant &#8220;blocks&#8221; of corn at least four rows deep. This ensures that the corn&#8212;which is pollinated by wind&#8212;has a greater chance of producing viable ears.&#10;PLANTING TIME : SPRING AND SUMMER ARE THE BEST SEASON FOR PLANTING IN MOST AREAS. YOU CAN PLANT ALL YEAR ROUND IN TROPICAL AREAS.&#10;FOLLOW ME ON INSTAGRAM ..:)&#10;INSTAGRAM LINK:-https://www.instagram.com/urbangarden...&#10;&#10;MUSIC:&#10;Mind your Time by Me.So https://soundcloud.com/me_so Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported &#8212; CC BY-SA 3.0 http://creativecommons.org/licenses/b... Music provided by Music for Creators https://youtu.be/MdyTZqbuVZE&#10;&#10;Mind your Time by Me.So https://soundcloud.com/me_so&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported  &#8212; CC BY-SA 3.0 &#10;http://creativecommons.org/licenses/b...&#10;Music provided by Music for Creators https://youtu.be/MdyTZqbuVZE&#10;&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qVX1QYtMjAk&#38;index=3&#38;list=PLrRVQ9K_8q5QFHikXYxFlvLT1krD1d9vx&#10;The Wilhelm Scream (Kygo Remix) | No Copyright&#10;&#8226; Music Master&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/Musicmasterpm&#10;Tumblr: http://musicmasterpm.tumblr.com/&#10;&#10;Jo Cohen &#38; Sex Whales - We Are&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C6IaUMAg3Dc&#10;NCS Spotify: http://spoti.fi/NCS&#10;&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/jcswweare&#10;&#10;Connect with NCS:&#10;Snapchat: ncsmusic&#10;&#8226; http://soundcloud.com/nocopyrightsounds&#10;&#8226; http://instagram.com/nocopyrightsounds_&#10;&#8226; http://facebook.com/NoCopyrightSounds&#10;&#8226; http://twitter.com/NCSounds&#10;&#8226; http://spoti.fi/NCS"
