    title "Container Gardening in Salt Lake City | Urban Garden and Farm Tour with Wasatch Community Gardens"
    description "Container gardening and vertical gardening are great ways to grow vegetables if you have little or no growing space, but there are more reasons than that to try these increasingly popular methods of gardening. We met with home gardeners Michael and Richard o see how they have used containers and trellises to work around some specific issues they have growing some of their most loved vegetables and fruit on their property. #containergardening #outdoorliving #urbangardening&#10;&#10;Check out our blog post! &#10;https://www.pbsutah.org/blogs/modern-gardener/container-gardening-and-vertical-gardening-in-salt-lake-city/&#10;&#10;If you love this video, please consider becoming a sustaining member of PBS Utah: https://pbsutah.pledgecart.org/pledgeCart3/?campaign=8433B0CC-79FE-4F97-9E15-05A14686D789&#38;source=#/home&#10;&#10;If you live in Utah and have a garden or garden project that you'd like to be featured on Modern Gardener, click here: https://www.pbsutah.org/blogs/modern-gardener/dont-keep-your-garden-a-secret/&#10;&#10;For more about Wasatch Community Gardens:&#10;https://wasatchgardens.org/&#10;https://www.facebook.com/wasatchgardens/&#10;https://www.instagram.com/wasatchcommunitygardens/"
