    title "FULL Garden Tour + Harvest | WEEK 2 // Urban Gardening in NYC | May 2022"
    description "Welcome to my urban garden! My name is Mari and I'm gardening in Queens, New York City. Zone 7b. This is the 2nd week of the full garden tours I'll be doing through the 2022 growing season where I show everything that is going on in my garden. &#10;&#10;This week we have a heat wave coming, and I'm harvesting some of my cool weather crops (lettuces, kale, broccoli etc) to make space for some heat loving crops that still need to be planted. &#10;&#10;FULL GARDEN TOUR WEEK ONE: https://youtu.be/QdXnsuJoNds&#10;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/marisgardenandkitchen&#10;Website: https://www.marisgardenandkitchen.com/&#10;Join my facebook group: https://www.facebook.com/groups/496772298156787&#10;&#10;My 2022 Grow List: https://youtu.be/8AZ6WQiTetM&#10;Why I started Gardening: https://youtu.be/n5AgwylkWVc&#10;&#10;2021 Garden Tour Playlist: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLHDaYPV0vsszVn2SDKjo5CKHHM_pM9GpG&#10;&#10;Gardening Playlist: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLHDaYPV0vsswZCVCZaYwUJ1WUmPPniPoA&#10;Cooking Playlist: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLHDaYPV0vsswAKBLjzmZQDnMpw56BnjRe&#10;&#10;GreenStalk Planter Discount: https://lddy.no/wndn&#8203;  &#10;Use code &#34;MARISGARDEN&#34; for $10 off $75+ order &#10;&#10;//&#10;&#10;#marisgardenandkitchen&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER: Links included in this description might be affiliate links. If you purchase a product with the links that I provide I may receive a small commission at NO extra cost to you. When you purchase through this links, you help supporting my channel (and my garden) helping me to continue to create free content!"
