    step 0
    date "2022-05-04T15:34:19Z"
    title "Composting Urban Gardening"
    description "This easy urban composting system has worked really well for us! We compost all of our kitchen scraps and chicken manure into a nutrient rich soil for our urban garden, where we grow lots of food for our family in the summer! Every year is a different process with different problems to troubleshoot, and this spring is no different. We only actively compost for one month out of the whole year and are able to manage the system on our relatively small town lot. Enjoy!"
