    description "If you&#8217;re new here, Welcome! My name is Mariana, I&#8217;m a trained chef and I am growing vegetables in Queens, NYC. This is week three of my urban garden tours. &#10;&#10;I'll be doing this garden tour weekly through the growing season. Tag along if you want to see the progress of my garden and the challenges that I face gardening in New York City. &#10;&#10;&#10;FULL Garden Tour | Week two: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fDC3t5gqUiA&#38;t=2s&#10;FIRST Full garden Tour (Week One) https://youtu.be/bKAguhjM3v4&#8203;&#10;Last week of March Garden Tour: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oSVzO...&#8203;&#10;First week of March Tour: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mVlqY...&#8203;&#10;Assembling my Original 5 tier Vertical Planter (GreenStalk): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_biGw...&#8203; &#10;&#10;February Garden Tour 2021 (My first video): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9soCj...&#8203; &#10;&#10;GreenStalk Plater Discount - Use code MARISGARDEN for $10 off your order https://lddy.no/wndn&#8203; &#10;&#10;Book recommended&#10;Gaia's Garden: A Guide to Home-Scale Permaculture https://bit.ly/3d4S39s&#8203;&#10;&#10;CAMERA GEAR:&#10;&#10;CANON M50 (Creator kit): https://bit.ly/313xiEn&#8203;&#10;Tripod: https://bit.ly/390Bady&#8203;&#10;&#10;Follow me along! &#10;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/marisgardenandkitchen&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER: Links included in this description might be affiliate links. If you purchase a product or service with the links that I provide I may receive a small commission. There is no additional charge to you. Thank you for using this links and supporting my channel so I can continue creating free content!"
