    title "Urban Gardening 101: Growing Your Own Ginger at Home (Episode 10)"
    description "Here's something that you can start at home. Growing your own ginger in a pot is easy, but you need to be patient and wait around 4-6 months before you can harvest your first ginger root (rhizome). Here in this Part 1 of the Ginger Series video, Urban Gardening Mom shows you how and when to harvest your own organic ginger. Next week, in Part 2, we'll show how to start your ginger from a a ginger root. Watch out for it! &#10;&#10;#UrbanGardeningMom&#10;#UrbanGardeningMomPH&#10;#UrbanGardeningMomTV&#10;#TheUrbanGardeningShop&#10;#UrbanGardeningNews&#10;#GrowYourOwnFood"
