    title "Grow Worlds Hottest Pepper in Pots | SEED TO HARVEST"
    description "HOTTEST PEPPER IN THE WORLD| CAROLINA REAPER&#10;Carolina Reaper is an easy to grow, low-maintenance plant. It is the hottest peppers in the world with a Scoville heat measurement of 2 million. It can be grown in containers, provided they receive enough sunlight and water.&#10;&#10;FUN FACTS: &#10;The Carolina Reaper is so strong, you're supposed to wear gloves when you hold it.&#10;The Carolina Reaper chilly is 400 times more spicy than the tasty Jalapeno peppers you can get on pizzas, which only rate a chilly 3,500 on the Scoville scale.&#10;It's the same species as the famously fiery Scotch bonnet chilly which is often used in West Indian cooking.&#10;It's not the seeds that make a chilly spicy, it's the white flesh nearest to the seeds that give it its kick&#10;Only mammals feel the heat of a chilly, they don't affect birds at all!&#10;&#10;GROWING TIME: SUMMER AND RAINY SEASON( JUNE-JULY-AUGUST MONTHS ARE IDEAL FOR SEED GERMINATION)&#10;&#10;BUY CAROLINAREAPER SEEDS: &#10;FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/valeyrac.ex/&#10;EBAY: https://www.ebay.com/str/valeyracexotics&#10;INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/accounts/login/?next=/valeyrac.ex/&#10;&#10;BUY IMPORTED VEGETABLE AND FLOWER SEEDS FROM MY SEED SELLER MR. ROHIT (WHATSAPP- 9818174630)&#10;&#10;NATURAL RIVER SAND - 5kg Grey &#10;https://amzn.to/3syf6BV&#10;&#10;BUY GROW BAGS :&#10; UV Treated Grow Bag, Multicolour, 12 x 12 inch, 10 Pieces&#10;https://amzn.to/3lsgZLS&#10;&#10;GROW BAGS: (18x18 inch, Pack of 8) &#10;https://amzn.to/2ZLpYjP&#10;&#10;Homemade Organic Fertilizer Organic &#38; Natural Plant Nutrient Cow Manure, Vermi compost Fertilizer (10 kg)&#10;https://amzn.to/3lrtqHX&#10;&#10;TrustBasket Organic Vermicompost Fertilizer Manure for Plants - 5 KG&#10;https://amzn.to/3plPBR2&#10;&#10;COCOPEAT 4KG BLOCK&#10;https://amzn.to/3rsPLbL&#10;&#10;Cocopeat Block 4 Qty Expands To 100 Kg Coco Peat Powder&#10;https://amzn.to/3rxSm4j"
