  [
    id 116
    label "HzVceY4OTCQ"
    step 0
    date "2021-09-30T05:09:37Z"
    title "Urban gardening: Vilnius  Kaunas"
    description "Over the last two decades urban gardening ideas have been growing in Europe and around the world: neighbors, communities and municipalities are creating gardens and orchards, growing a variety of goods from berries or salads to huge vegetables and fruits.&#10;In this way not only does the community itself grow organic food for its families or small businesses, but it also makes valuable use of free urban spaces, strengthens relationships and creates employment opportunities for those who might be in need.&#10;Unused vertical or horizontal areas, including courtyards, roofs or even walls are dedicated to these gardens. There is no need to look far for inspiration: here in Lithuania, we have several established examples of urban gardening that can be role models for communities dreaming of their own garden.&#10;September 29 6 p.m.: we invite you to talk about the possibilities and perspectives of urban gardening through examples of Lithuania and Finland.&#10;EVENT SPEAKERS:&#10;Vilnius city municipality (Au&#353;ra Si&#269;i&#363;nien&#279;, Urban Developement Department)&#10;Pilait&#279;s urban garden (Laura Petru&#353;kevi&#269;i&#363;t&#279;, co-founder)&#10;Antakalnio urban garden (R&#363;ta Aladavi&#269;ien&#279;, gardener)&#10;Dodo (Finland, www.dodo.org) (Malm Nordlund, Head of Organizational Developement)&#10;&#352;ilaini&#371; sodai urban garden (Evelina &#352;imkut&#279;, co-creator)&#10;Kur&#353;i&#371; kiemas urban garden (Renata Dumbravien&#279;, co-creator)&#10;A panel discusion will follow the presentations:&#10;Moderator: Evelina &#352;imkut&#279; (&#352;ilaini&#371; sodai urban garden)&#10;The event will be held at Miesto Laboratorija with an opportunity to watch live broadcast on YouTube.&#10;REGISTRATION: https://bit.ly/3yPeQOj&#10;Organisers: Miesto Laboratorija, Nordic Council of Ministers Office in Lithuania, &#352;ilaini&#371; sodai"
    channeltitle "Miesto laboratorija"
    channelid "UCA7ovJxuau7IOcbc19unMgw"
