    title "Grow Cabbage From Seeds | SEED TO HARVEST"
    description "HOW TO GROW CABBAGE IN CONTAINERS | CABBAGE IN POTS &#10;&#10;When it comes to planting, they do well in cold climate, plant them anytime when the temperature is in the range of 50-85 F (10-30 C). September to December months are best to start cabbage from seeds. At the time when it&#8217;s maturing, the ideal temperature is around 60-70 F (15-20 C). This ensures the best flavor and growth!&#10;&#10;GROWING TIME : SEPTEMBER TO JANUARY (when the temperature is in the range of 50-85 F (10-30 C))&#10;&#10;BUY IMPORTED VEGETABLE AND FLOWER SEEDS FROM MY SEED SELLER MR. ROHIT (WHATSAPP- 9818174630)&#10;&#10;BUY GROW BAGS :&#10; UV Treated Grow Bag, Multicolour, 12 x 12 inch, 10 Pieces&#10;https://amzn.to/3lsgZLS&#10;&#10;GROW BAGS: (18x18 inch, Pack of 8) &#10;https://amzn.to/2ZLpYjP&#10;&#10;Homemade Organic Fertilizer Organic &#38; Natural Plant Nutrient Cow Manure, Vermi compost Fertilizer (10 kg)&#10;https://amzn.to/3lrtqHX&#10;&#10;TrustBasket Organic Vermicompost Fertilizer Manure for Plants - 5 KG&#10;https://amzn.to/3plPBR2&#10;&#10;COCOPEAT 4KG BLOCK&#10;https://amzn.to/3rsPLbL&#10;&#10;Cocopeat Block 4 Qty Expands To 100 Kg Coco Peat Powder&#10;https://amzn.to/3rxSm4j&#10;&#10;TrustBasket Open Pollinated Cabbage Seeds&#10;https://amzn.to/3rqDmoL"
