    title "How To Grow Garlic At Home-Fast N Easy"
    description "HOW TO GROW GARLIC AT HOME-EASIEST METHOD EVER&#10;There are several reasons to plant garlic. First up, it is relatively easy to grow and highly rewarding. Also, growing your own garlic means you get to eat a fresh, organic product and one that hasn&#8217;t been imported. &#10;DAIZZ'S TIPS:-&#10;Growing your own garlic means you get to eat a fresh, organic product.&#10;1.) Grow it in a sunny, well-drained spot in the garden or in a pot.&#10;2.) Water your garlic plants regularly and fertilize through the growing season.&#10;3.) Harvested garlic bulbs can be stored and used over many months.&#10;&#10;MUSIC:-&#10;&#10;Bay Breeze by FortyThr33 https://soundcloud.com/fortythr33-43 Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported&#8212; CC BY 3.0 http://creativecommons.org/licenses/b... Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/XER8Zg0ExKU&#10;&#10;Happy Life by FREDJI https://soundcloud.com/fredjimusic&#10;https://www.facebook.com/fredjimusic/&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/u4PI5p5bI9k"
