    description "Hello there and welcome to my SMALL SPACE ORGANIC URBAN GARDEN, Join me for a tour of the garden as I harvest a few things for a camping trip BBQ. &#10;&#10;#smallspacegardening #organicgardening #urbangardening #vegetablegardentour #garden &#10;&#10;Please check out my Patreon for exclusive content &#10084;&#65039;&#10;https://www.patreon.com/LorenBird&#10;&#10;&#10;AYO CUSTOM SURFBOARDS&#10;https://www.ayosurfboards.com&#10;&#10;AOT RACING - MOTOX RIDING GEAR&#10;https://www.aotracing.com/online-store/cart&#10;&#10;SUR RON -HITCH CARRIER - (COMES WITH ANTI-RATTLING ADAPTER)&#10;https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B001IUV1CM/ref=as_li_tl?ie=UTF8&#38;camp=1789&#38;creative=9325&#38;creativeASIN=B001IUV1CM&#38;linkCode=as2&#38;tag=lbvlogshop-20&#38;linkId=897f33a2a55963a71a1f5d50edcdc812&#10;&#10;SUR RON -PROTAPER HANDLEBAR- WITH 80MM RISE(COMES WITH GRIPS &#38; BAR PAD) *MAKE SURE TO GET SOME 2-3MM RUBBER FOR FITTING*&#10;https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B08HLQZQKR/ref=as_li_tl?ie=UTF8&#38;camp=1789&#38;creative=9325&#38;creativeASIN=B08HLQZQKR&#38;linkCode=as2&#38;tag=lbvlogshop-20&#38;linkId=80d6492f18d4814f406da4266af22805&#10;&#10;SUR RON -FOOT PEG UPGRADE -(BIGGER PEGS)&#10;https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B07FDZWZCC/ref=as_li_tl?ie=UTF8&#38;camp=1789&#38;creative=9325&#38;creativeASIN=B07FDZWZCC&#38;linkCode=as2&#38;tag=lbvlogshop-20&#38;linkId=35f0b287ec5e1bf607254418f5340417&#10;&#10;SUR RON -OFF ROAD PHONE MOUNT- (HANDLEBAR PHONE MOUNT)&#10;https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B07SD3L5JR/ref=as_li_tl?ie=UTF8&#38;camp=1789&#38;creative=9325&#38;creativeASIN=B07SD3L5JR&#38;linkCode=as2&#38;tag=lbvlogshop-20&#38;linkId=6758f9f9b57e90e92360ded02dadc602&#10;&#10;FOX 2020 V1 HELMET&#10;https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B08CMQXV3M/ref=as_li_tl?ie=UTF8&#38;camp=1789&#38;creative=9325&#38;creativeASIN=B08CMQXV3M&#38;linkCode=as2&#38;tag=lbvlogshop-20&#38;linkId=7fa26b83f876e3974fd44adf33e3627a&#10;&#10;2020 FOX GLOVES&#10;https://www.amazon.com/gp/prod