  [
    id 154
    label "giBueUBd5ow"
    step 0
    date "2021-03-15T13:19:53Z"
    title "MY MINI URBAN GARDENING EXPERIMENT"
    description "I decided to set-up and do urban gardening at the apartment where we stay. Last week I planted a tomatoes (kamatis) seeds, ginger (luya) and an onion (sibuyas). After a week later a saw a sprout of tomotoes seedlings, today I decided to re-pot or replant it. I am praying and hopeful that my mini urban vegetable gardening will be successful and hopefully in a couple of months I can harvest (cross fingers) and eat fresh tomatoes."
    channeltitle "Jane A's channel"
