    id 188
    label "bSDbv82SIzM"
    step 0
    date "2021-07-07T13:22:42Z"
    title "BEGINNER GARDENER | URBAN GARDENING | HOME GARDENING 2021 | FARMERS MARKET TANAKA FARMS"
    description "#gardening #growfood #letsgetgrowing&#10;BEGINNER GARDENER | URBAN GARDENING | HOME GARDENING 2021| FARMER'S MARKET TANAKA FARMS&#10;&#10;Hello everyone! In this video we will be sharing our journey as a beginner gardener in our new house in Southern California. One of the reasons why we chose this new house is because of its backyard, we were planning to grow our own food in our backyard garden. We have no experience in gardening but we just wanted to document our urban gardening and home gardening journey. I have bought seeds early this year but since we moved to this new house mid year, i think we are already late in the planting season so we decided to just buy already grown vegetables from LOWES. Since not all vegetables were available, I may still have to plant the seeds and grow our own vegetables in our backyard. I will show you how to start a vegetable garden in your own home. We will be building our own garden bed in our backyard. Hopefully, we will be growing our own food in no time. We also went to Tanaka Farms to get gardening and farming inspiration as an urban garden or urban farm.&#10;&#10;I hope you have the best day - You deserve it! Love you guys!! See you all in our next video!&#10;&#9829;&#65039;Harvest and Gather&#10;&#10;If you liked this video and want to see more videos like this one please give this video a thumbs up and subscribe to my channel! &#10;&#10;Thank you for watching my video.&#10;&#10;Don't forget to SUBSCRIBE Click &#128073; https://tinyurl.com/harvest-gather &#10;&#10;ZWILLING VACUUM FOOD STORAGE :  https://www.talkable.com/x/uSJmlR&#10;&#10;&#10;Here is a link to a similar liquid chalk marker from the same brand that I used in my other videos:  &#10;LIQUID MARKER:  https://amzn.to/3dqQdwU&#10;SHELF LINER: https://amzn.to/3jCaTZp&#10;SPOON AND FORK SILVERWARE SET: https://amzn.to/3yx7csj&#10;BAMBOO UTENSIL ORGANIZER: https://amzn.to/3yj8lU5&#10;HOUSE SLIPPERS: https://amzn.to/3ydaGzM&#10;PACKAGING TAPE : https://amzn.to/2Q6jsPX&#10;MOVING BOXES: https://amzn.to/3gmOfm7&#10;STORAGE BOX: https://amzn.to/32oIZpJ&#10;SHARPIE :  https://amzn.to/3efsamF&#10;BUBBLE WRAP: https://amzn.to/2Qikh85&#10;CUSHION FOAM SHEETS: https://amzn.to/3ebJs4l&#10;MOVING LABELS: https://amzn.to/2RNZdqz&#10;PLASTIC FOOD WRAP: https://amzn.to/3dte0PD&#10;TRASH BAG: https://amzn.to/32oRzFd&#10;SCISSORS: https://amzn.to/2P1aseh&#10;&#13;CAMERA: https://amzn.to/3amSuKq&#10;&#10;&#10;Visit my website: https://www.harvestandgather.com &#10;&#10;&#127819;instagram: @_harvestandgather_ &#10;&#129381;email: friends@harvestandgather.com &#10;&#10;&#10;This post contains affiliate links, which means I make a small commission at no extra cost to you but helps me to create better videos.&#10;&#10;&#10;#gardening #growfood #letsgetgrowing #gardenanswer #homestead&#10;#beginnergardener #gardening101 #DIY #gardening2021&#10;BEGINNER GARDENER | URBAN GARDENING | HOME GARDENING 2021| FARMER'S MARKET TANAKA FARMS&#10;&#10;&#10;#acrehomestead #scandishhome #harvestandgather #scandinavianstyle #scandish #minimalism #simpleliving #thiscrazylife #housetour #hometour #emptyhousetour #emptyhometour #californiahomes #homemaking #cleaning  #cleaningvideos #cleaningvideo #2021 #cleaningmotivation #speedcleaning #clean #homemaking #sahm"
