    title "2021 GARDEN TOUR - Week 2 - URBAN GARDENING in Canada Zone 5B"
    description "Join me as I give you an update of my two very different urban gardens and harvest my first turnip of the season. I live in Canada and this is what I grow in zone 5B.  &#10;&#10;For the complete list and links to the different varieties I am growing, visit my blog www.veggiechompers.com.&#10;&#10;Reachin&#8217; Reverie : HOW TO PRUNE PEPPERS https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8bwO3WT_KlM&#10;&#10;Midwest Gardener : TOP 5 BEST TASTING TOMATOES https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PC_CMu_pQew &#10;______________________________________________ &#10;&#10;WELCOME TO VEGGIE CHOMPERS &#10;I&#8217;m on a journey to homesteading. I dream of owning a farm where I can grow all my food and live a sustainable and meaningful life. In the meanwhile, I find ways to be self sufficient in an urban environment.&#10;There are no affiliate links or sponsor in this video or in this description. &#10; ______________________________________________ &#10;&#10;Blog : www.veggiechompers.com &#10;Instagram : veggie_chompers&#10;______________________________________________ &#10;&#10;MUSIC &#10;Snake City &#8211; Tell You I&#8217;m Sorry (Insctrumental version) : https://www.epidemicsound.com/track/HDlCTSktth/"
