    id 200
    label "_f0a9-uVQFk"
    step 0
    date "2021-05-23T15:38:18Z"
    title "Celery Harvest - Urban Gardening in Austin Texas"
    description "After 6 long months, our winter garden harvest has begun! &#10;&#10;Celery has been one of my favorite vegetables to grow, its super easy to do, and I highly recommend it to anyone gardening in Austin Texas or Zone 8.&#10;&#10;In this video, i'll be cutting down some of our celery, and discussing how celery flowers and creates seeds. I hope you find this video fun and informative, if you have any questions, leave those down in the comments and I will address them!&#10;&#10;If you want to check out my video planting the winter garden, or some garden frost protection videos, where I protected my celery from the winter storms, check out my winter gardening playlist - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NHKsNfV_Vlo&#38;list=PLSMgcMx-WaxqmPKRSm2s6AHpPxpew1KEU&#38;ab_channel=AustinTexasGardeningAustinTexasGardening&#10;&#10;You can also see the celery's progress in my recent garden tours -&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MQ-hoEcoTo0&#38;list=PLSMgcMx-Waxq89YlQBKu9qUh2d0Jo3i07&#10;&#10;Thank you for watching Austin Texas Gardening!&#10;&#10;#AustinTexas&#8203; #Gardening&#8203; #Horticulture #Zone8B&#8203; #urbangardening&#8203;"
