    id 204
    label "1c8mLA1YdP0"
    step 0
    date "2020-10-03T16:39:31Z"
    title "Urban Gardening in Arlington, VA | SustainableScoop"
    description "Want to make your own interview? Check out our website at https://sustainablescoop.com/&#10;&#10;Urban gardening has blossomed in Arlington and during the COVID-19 pandemic, hundreds of volunteers are working to grow produce for local food pantries. I, Alistair Watson, interview three current gardeners to learn about what their goals are, what are the benefits of gardening, and what they have to say about Friends of Urban Agriculture (FOUA). Join me as I host and interview Lisa Labella, Ilana Rea, and David Sachs. See what they have to say about these questions and more! Follow us on our social media. Follow us on our social media @sustainablescoop&#10;&#10;#SustainableScoop #Sustainable #SustainableYouth"
    channeltitle "SustainableScoop"
    channelid "UCbpN1aegATVIImb7xYUFWZA"
    favcount 0
    viewcount 233
    likecount 13
    commentcount 3
