    title "5 Basics of Urban Gardening | Things you must know before you start"
    description "This video is for those who have been wanting to start urban gardening but don't know where to begin. &#10;&#10;I will be sharing with you the basics before you start with this new hobby.&#10;&#10;This is my 1st installment of the Urban Gardening videos. I hope you guys will learn something from this. Feel free to let me know in the comments section if you have any question or if you want any topics that you want me share with you. &#10;&#10;For the Kanduu Products that I have shared in this video, here's the details and link as promised:&#10;&#10;&#8226;&#160;KanMend&#160;- P100,000 Coverage when diagnosed with any of the 42 covered Critical Illnesses + 6 Months Unlimited Tele Consultation with KonsultaMD&#10;&#10;https://shop.fwd.com.ph/agency/agent/10006384/kan-mend/application&#10;&#10;&#8226;&#160;KanLive&#160;- P200,000 Coverage life protection + 1 Year Unlimited Consultation at any Aventus Medical Clinic&#10;&#10;https://shop.fwd.com.ph/agency/agent/10006384/kan-live/application&#10;&#10;&#8226;&#160;KanGuard&#160;- P500,000 Coverage for accidental death and/ or Disability through Terrorism + 1 Year Global Emergency Services with Assist America&#10;&#10;https://shop.fwd.com.ph/agency/agent/10006384/kan-guard/application&#10;&#10;Thank you for watching this video, please don't forget to give me a thumbs up and please subscribe to my channel.&#10;&#10;Disclaimer: Some of the images used in this infovideo was taken from different internet sources. This may or may not be a property of the video creator."
