    title "FULL GARDEN TOUR | WEEK TWO | 2021 {Urban Gardening in Queens, NYC. Zone 7b}"
    description "If you&#8217;re new here, Welcome! My name is Mariana, I&#8217;m a trained chef and I am growing vegetables in Queens, NYC. This is week two of my urban garden tours. I'll be doing this garden tour weekly through the growing season. Tag along if you want to see the progress of my garden and the challenges that I face gardening in New York City. &#10;&#10;&#10;FIRST Full garden Tour (Week One) https://youtu.be/bKAguhjM3v4&#10;Last week of March Garden Tour: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oSVzOxvWX2w&#38;t=84s&#10;First week of March Tour: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mVlqY4M993Q&#10;Assembling my Original 5 tier Vertical Planter (GreenStalk): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_biGwAcozXU &#10;&#10;February Garden Tour 2021 (My first video): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9soCjjvMWWM &#10;&#10;GreenStalk Plater Discount - Use code MARISGARDEN for $10 off your order https://lddy.no/wndn &#10;&#10;Book recommended&#10;Gaia's Garden: A Guide to Home-Scale Permaculture https://bit.ly/3d4S39s&#10;&#10;CAMERA GEAR:&#10;&#10;CANON M50 (Creator kit): https://bit.ly/313xiEn&#10;Tripod: https://bit.ly/390Bady&#10;&#10;Follow me along! &#10;&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/marisgardenandkitchen/&#10;Join my Facebook grouphttps://www.facebook.com/groups/496772298156787/&#10;&#10;#urbangardentour #urbangardening #marisgardenandkitchen&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER: Links included in this description might be affiliate links. If you purchase a product or service with the links that I provide I may receive a small commission. There is no additional charge to you. Thank you for using this links and supporting my channel so I can continue creating free content!"
