    title "MULBERRY AND PASSION FRUIT PICKING | URBAN GARDENING | FOOD FOREST"
    description "Hello Everyone! &#10;It's time for our Garden Tour 2021 and today I will show you the rooftop garden that my parents started 3 years ago. Mulberry and passion fruit are among the fruit trees that grow here. Healthy and fresh fruits is important to us. Especially in this time of uncertainty, we all need to be innovative and be resourceful. 3 years ago also, I started my first blog about creating a FOOD FOREST. A dream that someday we can produce our own food in our own backyard. Well, in this case in our rooftops :) That dream is now turning into a reality and if my parents can grow fruit trees in a small piece of land, why can't you? START PLANTING NOW ^_^&#10;Come and join Xavier (my son) in picking his favorite fruits. &#10;And if you're interested on what were planted here before, here is the link of my video of ROOFTOP GARDEN TOUR AND HARVEST 2018.&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f2lOkIDTlDM&#10;#mulberry #rooftop"
