    title "SFG Essentials | Urban Gardening with Rick Bickling"
    description "Rick Bickling, in partnership with Square Foot Gardening explains the benefits of the SFG Method in Urban Gardening. Square Foot Gardening is perfect for any community as it requires less space, less water and less maintenance. A Square Foot Garden can be placed almost anywhere and encourages people of all ages to get growing!&#10;.&#10;.&#10;[ Square Foot Gardening Books ]&#10;- All New Square Foot Gardening, 3rd Edition: https://amzn.to/3hMkJoQ&#10;- Square Foot Gardening with Kids: https://amzn.to/3yxp7Py&#10;&#10;[ Follow Us ]&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/squarefootgardeningorg/"
