    title "Urban gardening - Sprinkler irrigation - Apple HomeKit - Automation system"
    description "A Video about Urban gardening and an Automation Sprinkler irrigation system using Apple HomeKit. Micro Garden in the middle of the city.&#10;&#10;Timestamps:&#10;00:00 Intro&#10;00:46 The Garden Split&#10;01:03 Planting Pots&#10;01:19 How to collect water from the Rain Pipe&#10;02:32 Jet Pump to run the Sprinkler system&#10;03:22 Water irrigation Control with Apple Automation and HomeKit&#10;04:15 Automation at iPhone Apple HomeKit&#10;05:26 Water Pipes and Vents for Sprinkler System&#10;07:17 Sprinkler System in the Pots&#10;08:22 Running Sprinkler System&#10;09:05 Price for a self-made Irrigation System&#10;09:20 Improve gardening: Insect Hotel&#10;10:03 Improve gardening: Bird nests&#10;10:23 Garden Shrines&#10;10:44 Worm farm for compost and worm tea&#10;11:37 Plants for urban gardening&#10;15:13 Outro&#10;&#10;------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;You will find more amazing Spearfishing Content on my German/English BLOG&#10145;&#65039;&#10;www.harpune.info&#10;&#10;Searching for Spearfishing SPOTS/TUTORIALS? You will find my amazing Spearfishing Spot Maps on&#10145;&#65039;&#10;http://www.harpune.info/spearfishing-maps-guide/&#10;&#10;Follow me on FACEBOOK&#10145;&#65039;&#10;https://www.facebook.com/German.Spearfishing.Channel.2018/&#10;&#10;Become a PATREON&#10145;&#65039;&#10;https://www.patreon.com/germanspearfishingchannel/&#10;&#10;SPEARGUN:&#10;Good long one: https://amzn.to/2CB3i6F&#10;Good medium long one: https://amzn.to/33zggxw&#10;Fish reel: https://amzn.to/32z4jXj&#10;&#10;DIVE GEAR:&#10;THE BEST MASK OF ALL TIME: https://amzn.to/2qFKgJA&#10;Freediving Snorkel: https://amzn.to/2Q43ovw&#10;Good affordable Fins: https://amzn.to/2Q8YqNS&#10;Good Proffessional Fins: https://amzn.to/33F5MwD&#10;Get better at spearfishing: https://amzn.to/2rzsLLv&#10;Best dive Torch: https://amzn.to/2NB1gtq&#10;Warm water socks: https://amzn.to/34LgWjw&#10;Cold water socks: https://amzn.to/2X5RPp5&#10;Spearfishing Wetsuit: https://amzn.to/36QXELH&#10;&#10;Amazing dive knife: https://amzn.to/2NBTgs2&#10;Skinning knife: https://amzn.to/2O0Wcxx&#10;Filleting knife: https://amzn.to/2q4yQit&#10;&#10;TRAVEL&#10;Sportube travel with speargun: https://amzn.to/36TKeOW&#10;Travel bag cheap: https://amzn.to/36Zz5fF&#10;Perfect Dry Bag: https://amzn.to/374aM02&#10;&#10;CAMERA GEAR:&#10;Camera for POV underwater: https://amzn.to/2NDRbvZ&#10;Action Cam mounting set: https://amzn.to/374cZsm&#10;Selfie pole waterproof: https://amzn.to/2pa1P4b&#10;Drone I&#8217;m using: https://amzn.to/2rrNQHx&#10;Safe your files: https://amzn.to/2Kb2Wrn&#10;Camera light: https://amzn.to/2QaSwMm&#10;&#10;The links above are affiliate links, meaning Amazon will kick a small percentage back to me if you buy something through the link! &#10;It doesn't cost you anything but helps me in a good way to keep making videos for you.&#10;&#10;Greetings Chris"
