    id 281
    label "vKl2gvwd_z8"
    step 0
    date "2022-05-29T15:34:01Z"
    title "Creating Our Pumpkin Patch| Propagating Limelight Hydrangeas| Urban Gardening| May 2022"
    description "Hello Everyone! This week we had several storms come through and rip through our sunflower wall area, although we lost quite a few sunflowers all was not lost. I like how Ron Finley says that there are no mistakes just lessons and I decided to turn this into something positive by planting our pumpkins in the area that was originally for the sunflowers.  I am thankful that our planting season is long so that I have enough time to change things up a bit.  I hope you enjoy this video and thank you for joining us on our journey. I hope you find this video helpful and please like, comment and subscribe. Thank you for watching!&#10;&#10;Karen and Maya&#10;Email: sustainablychiclife@gmail.com&#10;&#10;I purchased all of our seeds and plants from:&#10;&#10;Lowes Home Improvement&#10;Durham Garden Center&#10;The Home Depot"
