    title " | Gardening | Urban Gardening | Growing Vegetables in Flower Pot Plants in Small Spaces"
    description "'Stay Home&#34; | Container Gardening | Urban Gardening | Growing Vegetables in Flower Pot Plants in Small Spaces&#10;&#10; If this Video has helped you and you would like to donate to my Channel please use the links below..&#10;&#10;Cash App: cash.me/$chefp2&#10;PayPal Direct:  https://www.paypal.com  (Send To Containercrops@gmail.com)&#10;Patreon:  https://www.patreon.com/chefandmore&#10;Amazon Wish List: https://www.amazon.com/hz/wishlist/ls/22US3UK2L2K4D&#10;&#10;Thank you for stopping by and joining me as I go on my journey of growing in small spaces.&#10;&#10;You don't need acres or a large yard to enjoy sustainable living by growing your own fruits and veggies.&#10;Just about anything that can be grown in the ground can also be grown in a container.&#10;&#10;Container gardens are perfect for decks, patios, small yards, kitchen counters and window sills.&#10;Creativity is key in Container Gardening.&#10;&#10;Let's raise our crops together.&#10;&#10;For recipes and food Ideas from your gardens visit:&#10;&#10;Youtube.com/c/chefandmore&#10;&#10;Business Email:&#10;containercrops@gmail.com&#10;&#10;Mailing Address:&#10;&#10;Container Crops&#10;c/o Chef Pam&#10;P.O. Box 561882&#10;Charlotte, NC 28213&#10;&#10;#ContainerCrops #GrowingInSmallSpaces #ChefAndMore #CropToKitchen #crops2kitchen **DISCLAIMER** &#10;Links included in this description might be affiliate links. As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.  If you purchase a product or service with the links that I provide I may receive a small commission. There is no additional charge to you! Thank you for supporting Chef and More as we can continue to provide you with great content!"
