    title "Urban Gardening: Grow Potatoes on your Balcony"
    description "Growing your own food plants in containers on your patio or balcony is easy and rewarding. Potatoes are one of the first you can plant in spring. Discover how to plant and care for your potted potatoes and why you should use certified seed potatoes.&#10;&#10;Welcome to RBG at Home, our commitment to offering accessible, diverse and entertaining learning opportunities for all ages.&#10;&#10;MORE: https://www.rbg.ca/athome&#10;&#10;--------------------------------------------------------&#10;SUPPORT ONLINE LEARNING:&#10;RBG is supporting children&#8217;s education during this difficult time by offering our new RBG at Home content which includes materials for students, teachers, families and lifelong learners.&#10;&#10;Donate today to help us create and deliver quality educational content that helps parents, children and teachers keep in touch with nature during this unprecedented time.&#10;https://www.rbg.ca/athome-donate&#10;&#10;--------------------------------------------------------&#10;Royal Botanical Gardens is made up of four distinct formal gardens contained within 1,100 hectares of nature reserve, across the municipalities of Hamilton and Burlington Ontario. See all our garden areas and start planning your visit at https://www.rbg.ca/gardensandtrails&#10;&#10;--------------------------------------------------------&#10;Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/RoyalBotanicalGardens&#10;Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/rbgcanada/&#10;Follow us on Twitter: https://twitter.com/RBGCanada"
