  [
    id 290
    label "AD4uqlcCYL0"
    step 0
    date "2021-06-05T12:05:35Z"
    title "planting out SUMMER VEGETABLES | backyard No Dig urban gardening | slow living silent vlog"
    description "&#127793;Between chilly spring nights, covering and uncovering, I&#8217;ve been planting out summer vegetables. Spacing can always be a challenge, but there are a few things that I do to make the most out of small backyard No Dig gardening. In this slow living silent vlog, I share what has been going on in backyard No Dig urban garden that is now full of summer vegetables.&#10;&#10;{ Vegetables, Fruits &#38; Flowers currently growing in balcony garden &#38; no dig backyard garden }&#10;Broad beans: Broad Windsor&#10;Snap peas: Sugar Ann, Sugar Snap&#10;Garlic: Moroccan Creole&#10;Black berry: Sweetie Pie&#10;Strawberry: Honeoye&#10;Tatsoi: NA *BOLTED&#10;Kohlrabi: Early purple Vienna&#10;Beets: Detroit dark red, Cylindra, Bulls blood, Chioggia, Golden Detroit&#10;Carrots: Longue rouge sang, New Kuroda&#10;Radish: Champion, White icicle&#10;Daikon radish: Minowase *BOLTED&#10;Kale: Dino, Russian red *BOLTED&#10;Onion: Yellow of Parma, White sweet Spanish&#10;Cabbage: Premium flat Dutch&#10;Lettuce: Tom Thumb, Flower, Buttercrunch, Paris island cos romaine, Black seeded Simpson&#10;Chinese Broccoli: NA&#10;Celery: Utah tall, Chinese celery&#10;Spinach: Bloomsdale long standing&#10;Chard: NA&#10;Chinese Cabbage: Chirimen Hakusai *BOLTED&#10;Chinese chive: NA&#10;Tomato: Barry&#8217;s crazy cherry, Pt. Pierre, Momotaro, House(started from store-bought tomatoes last year)&#10;Pepper: California wonder, Shishito&#10;Eggplant: Early long purple, Mitoyo, Mizu no takumi&#10;Squash: Honeynut&#10;Zucchini: Golden glory hybrid, Black beauty&#10;Bitter melon: House(started from home-saved seeds)&#10;Beans: Blue lake, Landreth&#10;Corn: Stowell&#8217;s evergreen, Glass gem&#10;Scallion: Evergreen&#10;Sunflower: Strawberry blonde&#10;Marigold: Kililmanjaro white&#10;Peony: Sarah Bernhardt, Felix Crousse&#10;Snapdragon: NA&#10;Bachelor&#8217;s button: NA&#10;Cosmos: Sea shells&#10;Poppy: Shirley double, Flemish antique, Frosted salmon, Mother of pearl&#10;Aster: King size apricot, Salmon Janina&#10;Herbs: Broad leaf Sage, Italian Oregano, Peppermint, Common Thyme, Lemon balm, chamomile, Basil&#10;&#10;From kiko&#10;&#10;::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::&#10;&#10;|| Music ||&#10;&#10;1. A place beyond belief by SLPSTRM&#10;https://artlist.io&#10;&#10;2. Self portrait by SLPSTRM&#10;https://artlist.io&#10;&#10;::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::&#10;&#10;#plantingoutsummervegetables #nodiggarden #slowlivingsilentvlog"
