    id 336
    label "7LHmBDBAE0g"
    step 0
    date "2022-03-16T20:00:01Z"
    title "Amending Raised Bed Soil and Planting First Seedlings | Urban Gardening in New York City"
    description "Welcome to my urban garden! My name is Mari and I'm gardening in Queens, New York City. Zone 7b. And today I'm amending my raised beds with local NYC compost and planting my first seedlings! Spring is just around the corner and I'm very excited for this garden season.&#10;&#10;Give me a follow on Instagram!&#10;https://www.instagram.com/marisgardenandkitchen&#10;&#10;Watch Next: &#10;Starting my first seedlings: https://youtu.be/6qs94ARhRPM&#10;Getting Compost at the Queens Botanical Garden: https://youtu.be/NSLE4WRDcqQ&#10;My 2022 Grow List: https://youtu.be/8AZ6WQiTetM&#10;My indoor Grow Light Set up: https://youtu.be/_Fj8thgaHZ8&#10;&#10;&#10;2021 Garden Tour Playlist:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLHDaYPV0vsszVn2SDKjo5CKHHM_pM9GpG&#10;&#10;&#10;GreenStalk Planter Discount: &#10;Use code &#34;MARISGARDEN&#34; for $10 off $75+&#10;https://lddy.no/wndn&#8203;  &#10;&#10;CAMERA GEAR:&#10;&#10;CANON M50 (Creator kit): https://bit.ly/313xiEn&#8203;&#10;Tripod: https://bit.ly/390Bady&#8203;&#10;&#10;#urbangardening #springgarden #marisgardenandkitchen&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER: Links included in this description might be affiliate links. If you purchase a product with the links that I provide I may receive a small commission at NO extra cost to you. When you purchase through this links, you help supporting my channel (and my garden) helping me to continue to create free content!"
