    id 342
    label "D7BBABRDdpU"
    step 0
    date "2022-06-14T12:08:23Z"
    title "Organics best urban gardening. Using sack farming and vertical farming methods."
    description "The lack of land in the cities makes farming difficult yet there is high demand for vegetables because of the high population. Most vegetables in the market contain o lot of chemicals since farming money, they harvest and sell their vegetable after spraying pesticides on them. It is therefore very important to cultivate your vegetables at home, which helps to save money and reduced the chemical residue level we consume in our body. Vertical farming and sacking farming are easy to do and they require less space. &#10;&#10;Join the lovely family by subscribing, liking, and commenting. &#10;&#10;&#10;Credit&#10;Songs from Youtube audio &#10; GAYO &#10;Isigeria Farms &#10;&#10;&#10;For more information; inquiries&#10;For further questions, send me a message on Instagram &#10;@Akentuna Evelyn &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Also, ask your questions in the comment section.&#10;&#10;E - M A I L  A D D R E S S&#10;Inquiries, contact me via email:&#10;akentunaevelyn97@gmail.com &#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;#urbanfarming &#10;#Sackfarming &#10;#verticalfarming &#10;#farming  &#10;#agribusiness"
