    id 343
    label "4cbF552trOc"
    step 0
    date "2022-03-15T15:00:05Z"
    title "Starting Tomato Seeds (On my birthday!) | Urban Gardening in New York City"
    description "Welcome to my urban garden! My name is Mari and I'm Gardening in Queens, New York City (Zone 7b). Today I'm starting my tomato seeds indoors to get ready for the 2022 growing season!&#10;&#10;Instagram:&#10;https://www.instagram.com/marisgardenandkitchen&#10;Johnny's 512 Soil Mix: https://www.johnnyseeds.com/tools-supplies/seed-starting-supplies/growing-media/johnnys-512-mix-20-qt.-9227.html#q=compost%2Bmix&#38;lang=en_US&#38;start=1 &#10;&#10;TOMATO VARIETIES&#10;&#10;Cherry Tomatoes:&#10;&#10;JASPER &#10;Supersweet 100 &#10;Sungold&#10;Yellow Pear&#10;Vernissage Art Color Mix&#10;Black Strawberry&#10;Brad's Atomic Grape&#10;Barry's Crazy Cherry&#10;Artisan Blush&#10;&#10;Slicer/Paste:&#10;&#10;Orange Accordeon &#10;Organge Jazz&#10;Thorburn's Terra-Cotta &#10;Striped German&#10;Sart Roloise &#10;Berkeley Tie-Dye Green &#10;Anans Noir&#10;Black Beauty&#10;Paul Robenson&#10;Purple Heart &#10;Midnight Roma &#10;Costoluto Genovese&#10;Amish Paste&#10;New Yorker Tomato&#10;Roma&#10;Berkeley Tie-Dye Pink&#10;Blue Beauty &#10;Indigo Rose &#10;&#10;2021 Garden Tour Playlist:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLHDaYPV0vsszVn2SDKjo5CKHHM_pM9GpG&#10;&#10;Timecodes:&#10;&#10;00:00 Intro&#10;00:30 Soil Mix&#10;00:37 Seedling Trays&#10;01:17 Labeling &#10;01:45 Explaining Watering&#10;02:40 Starting Seeds&#10;13:50 Watering Seeds&#10;&#10;// &#10;&#10;GreenStalk Garden VERTICAL PLATER Discount: https://lddy.no/wndn&#8203;  &#10;Use code &#34;MARISGARDEN&#34; for $10 off $75+ &#10;&#10;CAMERA GEAR:&#10;&#10;CANON M50 (Creator kit): https://bit.ly/313xiEn&#8203;&#10;Tripod: https://bit.ly/390Bady&#8203;&#10;&#10;#tomatoseeds #marisgardenandkitchen&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER: Links included in this description might be affiliate links. If you purchase a product with the links that I provide I may receive a small commission at NO extra cost to you. When you purchase through this links, you help supporting my channel (and my garden) helping me to continue to create free content!&#10;&#10;Thank you much for using these links!"
