    id 346
    label "8msuiCzBU_U"
    step 0
    date "2022-05-08T13:22:51Z"
    title "Companion Planting Cucumbers and Dill in Containers| Raised Bed Urban Gardening| Spring| May 2022"
    description "Hello Everyone! Today I am planting sunflower seeds and finishing off a little companion planting projects. Last year the insects had a field day with my cucumber and zucchini so I am trying to see if this way of planting can prevent that.  I am thankful that our planting season is long so that I have enough time to make corrections.  I hope you enjoy this video and thank you for joining us on our journey. I hope you find this video helpful and please like, comment and subscribe. Thank you for watching!&#10;&#10;Karen and Maya&#10;Email: sustainablychiclife@gmail.com&#10;&#10;I purchased all of our seeds and plants from:&#10;&#10;Lowes Home Improvement&#10;Durham Garden Center&#10;The Home Depot"
    channeltitle "Karen and Maya"
