    date "2021-12-02T14:27:08Z"
    title "Urban Gardening in December - Harvesting and whats Growing in December - Family Garden Tour Vlog"
    description "Urban Garden in December - Family Vlog &#10;&#10;&#10;It has been a while... Have not really been in the garden.. because I think a fox has moved in under our shed.. poo everywhere and half eaten rodents... &#128563;&#160; and overall just a lack of motivation... if you know you know... &#10;&#10;So back in our gorgeous December garden... &#128525;&#160; had to do some December harvesting and checking up on what's growing in December! &#10;&#10;My broad beans and peas are starting to grow!&#160; My mint and rosemary are going strong... my Chard unfazed by the frost recently! Garlic doing good as expected!&#10;&#10;&#10;I still have my onions and more garlic to put in! Don't really know what I am waiting for... Christmas? &#128517; &#10;&#10;Please support us by Liking, Sharing and Subscribing! It will does motivate me! &#10;&#10;Thank you all those who do watch our videos... we love and appreciate you... &#10;&#10;Leave us a comment we would love to get to know you! &#10;&#10;Peace and love&#10;#Fromourgarden &#10;&#10;&#10;Music used in this video&#160; &#127925;&#127925;&#127925;&#127925;&#127925;&#127925; &#10;&#10;INTRO&#10;&#10;&#10;Path Switch by tubebackr https://soundcloud.com/tubebackr&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution-NoDerivs 3.0 Unported &#8212; CC BY-ND 3.0&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://bit.ly/3EoNQsO&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/iQjFksXBSMU &#10;&#10;Gardening &#10;Garden&#10;Urban garden&#10;December garden&#10;December harvest &#10;&#10;&#10;Way Home by Tokyo Music Walker https://soundcloud.com/user-356546060&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported &#8212; CC BY 3.0&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://bit.ly/tokyo-music-walker-way-home&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/pJThZlOuDtI &#10;&#10;December Gardening &#10;Urban Gardening in December &#10;&#10;Sleepy Day by Another Kid https://soundcloud.com/another-kid&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported &#8212; CC BY 3.0&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://bit.ly/2YTm487&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/MBAbOP7uPaQ &#10;&#10;December &#10;Uk Garden &#10;London Gardening &#10;Urban garden in Uk&#10;what can you harvest in December?&#10;What can you grow in December?"
