    title "Balcony Garden tour / patio garden / urban gardening"
    description "CORRECTION: Okra should have been Bittermelon (Ampalaya)&#10;&#10;&#10;Urban, balcony or patio gardening is fun!  You can do it too!  All you need are seeds of your choice, potting mix, containers, homemade or store-bought fertilizer/food&#8230;and soon enough, you will be enjoying your homegrown,  crunchy and freshly picked fruits and vegetables. &#10;&#10;I&#8217;ve been doing it since 2019 and I thought it&#8217;s time to show you guys what I&#8217;ve planted thus far.  Fortunately, I&#8217;ve had great success. My faves to plant are #tomatoes and #sunflowers. &#10;&#10;I don&#8217;t have an educational background in gardening and am not a plant expert, but I know, and I think you will agree, that just like humans, plants need 5 things to grow and flourish: water, food, sun, air and LOVE(!). &#10;&#10;#balconygarden #patiogarden #urbangardening #plants #vegetables #fruit #organic #tomatoes #sunflowers #okra #gardening #balcony"
