    id 448
    label "4Iei17PB2J8"
    step 0
    date "2022-03-20T12:59:54Z"
    title "Building a No Dig Raised Bed w/Cardboard| Urban Gardening| Spring Garden Prep| March 2022"
    description "Hello Everyone! It is almost Spring!!!!!! Can you tell I am so excited! For a while now I have been thinking about adding another raised bed but did not know exactly where to place it as I wanted to be able to combine both Spring and Summer veggies. So we came up with the idea of extending the raised beds around the others. It has turned out great and  I love the idea of flowers, veggies and herbs growing together forming a beautiful space for both the pollinators and our family. I hope you enjoy this video and thank you for joining us on our journey. I hope you find this video helpful and please like, comment and subscribe. Thank you for watching!&#10;&#10;Karen and Maya&#10;Email: sustainablychiclife@gmail.com&#10;&#10;I purchased all of our seeds from:&#10;&#10;Lowes Home Improvement&#10;Durham Garden Center&#10;The Home Depot"
