    step 0
    date "2021-06-12T08:45:12Z"
    title "Balcony Garden Tour || Grow your own food || Urban Gardening || Fruits, Vegetables and Kitchen Herbs"
    description "Hello Everyone! &#10;&#10;Kumusta po kayong lahat?&#10;&#10;May mga nagtatanong kung bakit ndi na daw ako nagluluto or active sa YOUTUBE?&#10;&#10;So heto na po ang isa sa dahilan! Ang aking pagiging PLANTITA! Hehe!&#10;&#10;Nag start akong mag garden 2 months ago (April) dahil nag start ng gumanda ang weather dito sa Germany dahil pa Summer na. Ma-trabaho at magastos siyang gawin but it is worth it! &#10;Heto na din ang pinaka stress reliever ko. LOL! &#10;&#10;So far heto na po ang hitsura ng aking Edible Balcony Garden. Soon i will tour you sa aking Flower Garden naman! Enjoy watching! :)&#10;&#10;Plant List:&#10;1. Basil&#10;2.Lavender&#10;3.Rosemary&#10;4.Sage&#10;5.Thai Basil (Nakalimutan kong ipakita sa video haha!)&#10;6.Green Bellpepper&#10;7.Spinach&#10;8.Green/Spring onion&#10;9.Gurke/Cucumber&#10;10.Parsley&#10;11.Kangkong&#10;12.Pak Choi/Pechay&#10;13.Red Bellpepper&#10;14.Thyme&#10;15.Okra (Ndi na lumaki, LOL)&#10;16.More Basil&#10;17.Mint&#10;18.Kalabasa&#10;19-23. 5 Different kinds of Tomatoes &#10;24. 2x Jalapeno&#10;25. 2x Cayenne Pepper&#10;26. 2x Peperoni&#10;27. Lemongrass&#10;28.Laurel&#10;29.Red radish&#10;30.Blackberry&#10;31.Blueberry&#10;32.Strawberry &#10;33.Mulberry&#10;34. Ruccola&#10;and more to grow........ :)"
