    title "Creating No Dig Zones Throughout the Garden| Raised bed Urban Gardening| Springtime April 2022"
    description "Hello Everyone! Today we are sorting out all of the growing zones in our garden. We are making plans to add crush and run gravel to our driveway as well as between the raised beds to help prevent so many weeds.  We are in the early phase of planning so if we run into any issues we don't have to dig beneath tons of rock in order to correct the problem.  I hope you enjoy this video and thank you for joining us on our journey. I hope you find this video helpful and please like, comment and subscribe. Thank you for watching!&#10;&#10;Karen and Maya&#10;Email: sustainablychiclife@gmail.com&#10;&#10;I purchased all of our seeds from:&#10;&#10;Lowes Home Improvement&#10;Durham Garden Center&#10;The Home Depot"
