    title "How Togo is Using Urban Gardening To Fight Climate Change Interesting!"
    description "Although the predictions for climate change are dire, they are not inevitable. Just as serious consequences are projected, the impacts will be significantly lessened if we take steps now to reduce our carbon pollution. We can also take actions to help both natural and human communities adapt to the changes that are already underway.&#10;Urban Gardeners are both stewards and guardians of our environment, and can make a difference in the fight against climate change.&#10;Togo is doing very well with the implementation of this initiative to provide a very serene and  green environment, at the same time saving our earth from the heat of climate change.&#10;Let us all join in the fight. Our dump sites on the streets of our cities could be transformed into a very unique garden like how Togo is doing theirs.&#10;&#10;&#10;IMPORTANT NOTE: This video on this channel was  not originally captured by Climatechange Crusaders but were taken from  a platform.&#10;&#10;Furtherance, we acknowledge our source and leave the channel's subscription links / social media handles to promote the work.&#10; www.youtube.com/watch?v=AX5p3HcAi6M&#38;t=74s&#10;&#10;email us; climatechangecrusaders23@gmail.com&#10;&#10;&#10;#climate #togo #globalwarming #fightclimatechange #fightglobalwarming #globalwarming"
