    id 573
    label "Ur39I-Ts2cA"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-10T12:00:13Z"
    title "Gardening in a small space: You can still grow A LOT of food!"
    description "I am really excited about today's video because this is my first ever garden tour! This video will show you how gardening in a small space can still yield a lot of food! I made this video in hopes that it would give some inspiration to anyone that would like to grow some food and garden but doesn't have much space or land to do so. I garden in two raised beds and containers but I am still able to grow more than 30 pepper plants, 10 eggplants, and more than 20 tomato plants! I grow a wide variety of vegetables and fruit on our little urban homestead. I hope you enjoy the video and have a wonderful day!"
    channeltitle "Creekwood Farmhouse"
    channelid "UCHsE0FxTpVevK_cW0edqYpg"
