    title "How To Grow And Harvest Basil For Unlimited Leaves | Urban Gardening"
    description "These are some easy propagation and pruning techniques that will allow you to have endless amounts of basil, all year round. I found it challenging to grow basil all year and using these tips I have basil for use in my kitchen all year round. Happy gardening everyone! Sending you some gardening magic along with these tips.&#10;&#10;I live in USDA zone 10A&#10;Find your USDA Zone: https://planthardiness.ars.usda.gov&#10;&#10;&#10;This video shows my secrets to growing healthy roses: https://youtu.be/OsKakzRCwwM&#10;&#10;I have previously created a video of My Favorite 8 Rose Varieties for Beginner Gardeners (ft. David Austin Roses). If you would like to watch it, here is the link: https://youtu.be/vhwS_KdO7KI&#10;&#10;Like, comment, and subscribe to stay updated with my latest content.&#10;&#10;Follow me: Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/amritabhortake/&#10;&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/amritabhortake&#10;&#10;Website: http://www.amritabhortake.com&#10;&#10;Gear used in the video:&#10;Sony A7IV: https://amzn.to/3tDATHb&#10;Sigma lens: https://amzn.to/3JpRiFI&#10;&#10;My commonly used gear:&#10;1. My main photo camera: https://amzn.to/3zhDw2N&#10;2. Nikon Micro 105mm F2.8 lens: https://amzn.to/3DhH8o5&#10;3. Black Foam Board: https://amzn.to/3mAhkwW&#10;4. 5 in 1 reflector: https://amzn.to/3jSNVMX&#10;5. Rode Video Mic Pro+: https://amzn.to/3yidVWv&#10;6. Sony A6400 with kit lens: https://amzn.to/3jfhAji&#10;7. MeFoto Tripod: https://amzn.to/2UNtNm5&#10;8. Heavy Duty Light Stand: https://amzn.to/3yfe1xN&#10;9. Sigma 50mm ART 1.4 lens: https://amzn.to/3bvhKyD&#10;10. Aputure 120DII light: https://amzn.to/3DsfJQu&#10;11. Light Dome: https://amzn.to/3ycLZ65&#10;&#10;&#10;Disclaimer: Some links included in this description might be affiliate links. If you purchase a product or service with the links that I provide, I may receive a small commission. There are no additional charges to you.&#10;&#10;#urbangardening   #basil #beginnergardening"
